WEBVTT

00:13.221 --> 00:15.015
Hold on tight to your load!

00:15.098 --> 00:16.099
Of course.

00:17.017 --> 00:18.018
Witch!

00:18.518 --> 00:20.437
The bridge is under that tree!

00:26.484 --> 00:28.403
Please take me with you.

00:28.486 --> 00:31.156
I know I can help. I promise.

00:33.324 --> 00:34.242
Agott,

00:35.368 --> 00:37.912
this isn't like the usual assignments.

00:38.538 --> 00:40.915
There are plenty
of ordinary people around.

00:41.499 --> 00:44.210
You haven't even taken the second exam

00:44.294 --> 00:47.047
that allows you to use magic
in front of them.

00:47.130 --> 00:48.256
So for now--

00:49.382 --> 00:51.551
If not now, then when?!

00:51.634 --> 00:53.803
I've been practicing on my own too.

00:53.887 --> 00:55.889
So I can use magic in front of people.

00:56.389 --> 00:59.684
I've been preparing for the exam
for a long time now.

00:59.768 --> 01:04.689
Shouldn't the master give an apprentice
more chances to gain experience?

01:05.273 --> 01:06.941
Even still...

01:07.025 --> 01:08.026
Hurry, please!

01:09.110 --> 01:11.029
We need to get back at once!

01:12.072 --> 01:13.448
I'll go on ahead.

01:13.531 --> 01:16.951
I'll set up a window-way
on the other side.

01:18.703 --> 01:21.081
You get the medicine
and contraption ready.

01:21.956 --> 01:23.541
I'll take Agott with me.

01:25.043 --> 01:27.003
I'll go grab my cloak and hat.

01:29.297 --> 01:30.381
- Right.
- Right.

01:30.465 --> 01:31.674
We're coming too!

01:35.178 --> 01:37.138
Don't give me that look.

01:38.056 --> 01:40.683
Some things you only understand
when you see reality.

01:41.559 --> 01:43.019
I'm worried.

01:44.062 --> 01:45.522
Especially about Agott.

01:46.106 --> 01:48.024
She's too focused on the frustration

01:48.108 --> 01:50.902
of what she can't do
than the joy of what she can.

01:54.239 --> 01:56.157
Being inexperienced isn't a sin.

01:57.575 --> 01:59.160
In her rush to improve,

02:01.329 --> 02:04.040
I hope she doesn't lose her footing.

02:10.630 --> 02:12.257
The footing is unstable.

02:12.882 --> 02:14.634
I see it! That's it!

04:01.741 --> 04:05.745
MAGIC FOR SOMEONE

04:05.828 --> 04:06.829
That's...

04:08.831 --> 04:10.583
A witch!

04:11.376 --> 04:13.753
Thank goodness. We're safe now.

04:13.836 --> 04:16.214
Hey! A witch is here!

04:16.297 --> 04:17.340
Agott.

04:18.633 --> 04:20.510
You know how to use this, right?

04:21.761 --> 04:24.222
Use that to dry everyone's clothes.

04:24.806 --> 04:26.432
Once you're done, stand by.

04:28.309 --> 04:31.396
Am I just using this contraption?

04:31.896 --> 04:33.815
- There's nothing else?
- That's all.

04:35.066 --> 04:37.235
What else is there?

04:38.528 --> 04:40.697
Too easy? Not challenging enough?

04:42.031 --> 04:44.117
It seems Qifrey is right to worry.

04:45.743 --> 04:46.744
Agott,

04:48.663 --> 04:50.248
you're rushing.

04:52.417 --> 04:56.254
If you want to prove yourself,
there are other places for that.

04:56.838 --> 05:00.091
But if you want to help here and now,

05:00.591 --> 05:04.512
think carefully about why you use magic.

05:09.350 --> 05:13.604
Treating me like a useless child again.

05:14.856 --> 05:18.860
No matter how hard I work,
it means nothing if I can't show results.

05:20.069 --> 05:23.114
I need to prove to that person
as soon as possible

05:24.365 --> 05:27.493
that I'm a witch
with more value than this.

05:49.474 --> 05:50.850
Amazing!

05:50.933 --> 05:52.685
Would you look at that?!

05:52.769 --> 05:54.771
He's splitting the river with a sword!

05:54.854 --> 05:57.982
Hey, back up! The ledge is dangerous!

05:58.066 --> 06:00.651
Olruggio! How many in total?

06:00.735 --> 06:03.696
Two! I'm bringing in the first one now!

06:08.826 --> 06:10.828
This is pretty rough.

06:11.329 --> 06:13.247
This is why I hate water.

06:13.956 --> 06:14.999
Hang on!

06:15.083 --> 06:16.793
I'll try to be quick!

06:19.003 --> 06:19.962
Okay!

06:20.046 --> 06:22.048
- You're good!
- Got it!

06:42.652 --> 06:43.736
We did it.

06:44.445 --> 06:46.239
Everyone's safe.

06:46.322 --> 06:47.365
Nice work.

06:51.702 --> 06:52.620
Custas!

06:53.204 --> 06:54.122
Dagda!

06:57.750 --> 06:58.918
I'm sorry.

06:59.001 --> 07:02.004
I tried to protect your cargo, but...

07:02.839 --> 07:03.840
It's fine.

07:03.923 --> 07:05.341
As long as you're okay.

07:07.802 --> 07:10.680
Thank you very much.

07:10.763 --> 07:13.349
No, I'm glad we made it in time.

07:13.850 --> 07:16.477
My apprentices have the medicine.

07:16.561 --> 07:18.563
They'll treat your injuries there...

07:20.398 --> 07:23.151
Wow!

07:23.234 --> 07:24.819
- That's insane.
- So cool!

07:24.902 --> 07:26.404
I'm just a bit curious is all.

07:26.487 --> 07:28.656
This is the absolute best!

07:28.739 --> 07:31.159
Master Qifrey, what is this?

07:32.994 --> 07:36.164
This is the Raincleaver.

07:38.416 --> 07:41.794
Every pattern carved into the blade
is a seal.

07:42.545 --> 07:44.714
Even small seals,
if you gather enough of them,

07:45.298 --> 07:47.467
can split open the sea.

07:49.135 --> 07:53.139
Master Qifrey, can I hold it for a second?

07:53.222 --> 07:54.557
Nope.

07:55.141 --> 07:58.853
Magic cast on weapons
needs to be handled with caution.

07:59.770 --> 08:01.147
It's dangerous,

08:01.647 --> 08:04.066
so I can't let you guys touch it yet.

08:07.820 --> 08:10.740
I'll go check upstream, just in case.

08:11.324 --> 08:14.118
Then I'll go check the damage downstream.

08:14.827 --> 08:16.370
Tetia, come with me.

08:17.330 --> 08:18.498
Okay!

08:18.581 --> 08:20.541
- Richeh, you're with me.
- Got it.

08:22.335 --> 08:24.587
You two, hold things down here.

08:24.670 --> 08:25.755
We'll be right back.

08:25.838 --> 08:27.590
Okay!

08:39.060 --> 08:41.020
This is really awkward.

08:41.854 --> 08:45.274
I need to fix Agott's sylph shoes soon
and give them back to her.

08:47.401 --> 08:49.403
All done!

08:49.487 --> 08:52.281
Thanks, little witch.

08:54.951 --> 08:57.537
Little witch?

08:57.620 --> 09:00.540
Little witch, huh?

09:01.165 --> 09:02.500
Oof.

09:03.292 --> 09:04.794
But still,

09:04.877 --> 09:08.256
half the cargo got washed away.

09:08.756 --> 09:11.259
Custas! What are you doing?

09:11.342 --> 09:13.928
Get back here, Custas!

09:14.011 --> 09:16.013
It's fine, Dagda.

09:16.097 --> 09:18.182
The bank dips in here.

09:18.266 --> 09:20.935
Our stuff's caught in it.

09:21.018 --> 09:23.521
I'll grab it and come right back.

09:26.023 --> 09:27.191
You idiot!

09:27.275 --> 09:28.568
If it dips in,

09:28.651 --> 09:30.319
it means it's collapsed once.

09:31.112 --> 09:32.321
Get back here now!

09:53.926 --> 09:54.802
No...

09:54.885 --> 09:56.262
That can't be.

09:58.264 --> 10:00.558
- No... no...
- You can't, Mr. Dagda!

10:00.641 --> 10:02.351
It'll collapse again!

10:02.435 --> 10:03.561
Let me go!

10:04.520 --> 10:05.771
Agott!

10:12.528 --> 10:15.573
- Don't tell me she's buried--
- Agott!

10:15.656 --> 10:18.034
Here! Over here!

10:19.827 --> 10:22.830
Are you okay?! Are you hurt?

10:23.414 --> 10:24.957
I'm fine!

10:25.708 --> 10:27.543
Whoa! But...

10:29.420 --> 10:30.504
Answer me!

10:37.094 --> 10:38.763
It can't be...

10:40.598 --> 10:42.600
What do I do? What...

10:43.768 --> 10:44.727
That's it!

10:46.395 --> 10:49.023
There's a witch here.

10:49.607 --> 10:51.150
- What?
- Please!

10:51.734 --> 10:53.986
You can use magic to save him, right?!

10:54.987 --> 10:57.907
Please, save him!

11:01.410 --> 11:03.913
This is my chance!

11:04.955 --> 11:06.957
I mean, the masters aren't here.

11:07.041 --> 11:09.377
I don't have my sylph shoes
so I can't go get them.

11:09.460 --> 11:12.797
Coco can't move.
It's an emergency situation.

11:13.381 --> 11:15.633
If I save him with my magic,

11:15.716 --> 11:18.260
maybe I can prove myself to that person.

11:18.886 --> 11:19.887
Miss?

11:20.888 --> 11:23.516
Are you going to use magic now?

11:24.392 --> 11:26.936
She's gonna save them with magic.

11:27.019 --> 11:29.188
What kind of magic will we get to see?

11:29.271 --> 11:32.233
Stop that. Custas is in danger.

11:34.235 --> 11:36.737
Now show me, Agott.

11:39.782 --> 11:42.410
Is this the girl's magic?

11:45.830 --> 11:48.374
Compared to the other kids...

11:48.457 --> 11:50.334
Draw like you mean it.

11:50.418 --> 11:52.753
It's not bad, but it's ordinary.

11:52.837 --> 11:54.672
Hard to believe she's her daughter.

11:54.755 --> 11:57.341
Talented children can do more at this age.

11:57.425 --> 11:58.843
Are you even practicing?

11:58.926 --> 12:01.971
She's still just a child...

12:02.054 --> 12:06.434
I had such high hopes for you.
I'm disappointed, Agott.

12:06.517 --> 12:08.102
I won't take you as apprentice.

12:08.185 --> 12:11.439
Our clan has no need for the talentless.

12:18.028 --> 12:20.030
Why am I remembering this?

12:20.114 --> 12:22.366
Why now?

12:24.910 --> 12:26.120
Agott!

12:27.621 --> 12:29.415
What can I do?

12:30.499 --> 12:33.043
Is there something I can do from here?

12:37.506 --> 12:39.675
What can I do

12:39.759 --> 12:42.678
to save Custas?

12:45.264 --> 12:47.183
If you want to help here and now,

12:48.100 --> 12:51.729
think carefully about why you use magic.

12:54.648 --> 12:56.317
Coco! Can you move?!

12:56.400 --> 12:58.527
I need to know the situation!

12:59.028 --> 13:01.697
Well, um,

13:01.781 --> 13:05.826
the bank dips here,
so the current is slower.

13:05.910 --> 13:08.287
I don't think we'll be swept away!

13:08.370 --> 13:11.999
But it's all muddy and slippery.

13:12.541 --> 13:14.335
I don't think I can climb up.

13:14.919 --> 13:17.379
Custas is unconscious.

13:17.463 --> 13:20.424
The rock is too big
for even an adult to move.

13:22.885 --> 13:23.844
And...

13:27.431 --> 13:32.436
We can't let ordinary people
see us drawing magic.

13:33.312 --> 13:34.355
What should I do?

13:34.438 --> 13:35.940
Agott!

13:37.107 --> 13:38.609
What am I supposed to do?

13:47.618 --> 13:48.994
Easthies.

13:49.078 --> 13:51.789
We've got a report
from a village near Kalhn.

13:51.872 --> 13:53.999
They say they saw a massive jet of water

13:54.583 --> 13:56.710
upstream of the Marshwoods.

13:58.629 --> 13:59.839
Let's go.

14:04.552 --> 14:08.722
Even in a situation like this,
she hasn't given up.

14:12.852 --> 14:14.979
If only we could use magic.

14:16.814 --> 14:17.731
Agott!

14:18.816 --> 14:21.652
Hey, do you have it? That thing!

14:21.735 --> 14:22.611
Thing?

14:22.695 --> 14:25.030
You know, um,

14:25.114 --> 14:28.325
Master Olruggio's ring!

14:29.118 --> 14:30.536
Right!

14:30.619 --> 14:32.037
Link Rings!

14:34.164 --> 14:35.708
With this,

14:37.293 --> 14:38.961
if I had some paper,

14:39.044 --> 14:41.505
I could use the levitation spell
I just learned

14:41.589 --> 14:43.632
to lift the rock and save Custas.

14:44.842 --> 14:45.801
But

14:46.302 --> 14:48.137
Coco won't be able to do it.

14:49.054 --> 14:52.975
When a witch draws magic
in front of an Outsider,

14:53.058 --> 14:57.021
they have to completely hide their hands
in their long cloak.

14:57.855 --> 15:01.567
It takes special skill
to draw from fingertip memory alone.

15:09.074 --> 15:11.076
- What's she up to?
- She's still a child, so...

15:11.160 --> 15:11.994
But she's a witch...

15:12.077 --> 15:13.037
Everyone!

15:17.041 --> 15:19.251
I am Qifrey's top apprentice.

15:19.335 --> 15:22.254
The witch Agott Arklaum.

15:22.838 --> 15:25.382
Allow me to show you

15:25.466 --> 15:27.259
the magic granted to me.

15:29.887 --> 15:32.014
All the training I've put in

15:32.097 --> 15:35.768
is so I won't hesitate when it counts.

15:38.354 --> 15:40.105
Coco can't do it,

15:41.607 --> 15:42.775
but I can!

15:44.944 --> 15:45.861
Whoa!

16:00.584 --> 16:02.169
Incredible.

16:10.844 --> 16:13.639
We just practiced levitation
on hard potatos.

16:15.724 --> 16:18.268
I'm sure even I could do this!

16:24.108 --> 16:25.442
It's no use...

16:26.360 --> 16:28.821
I know, because I practiced.

16:29.363 --> 16:32.032
To move a rock this heavy,
a seal drawn in my palm quire

16:32.950 --> 16:34.994
is just not big enough.

16:37.579 --> 16:39.289
Custas!

16:39.373 --> 16:41.917
Huh? I...

16:42.418 --> 16:44.795
Thank goodness! You're awake.

16:44.878 --> 16:46.630
You're...

16:46.714 --> 16:49.299
I'm Coco, a witch.

16:49.383 --> 16:52.803
We fell from above. Do you remember?

16:54.805 --> 16:58.350
So I'm still alive?

16:58.976 --> 17:01.311
I can see a bird of light,

17:01.895 --> 17:03.731
so I thought I'd died.

17:03.814 --> 17:06.650
Oh, that? That's magic!

17:06.734 --> 17:08.569
That's my friend's magic!

17:10.279 --> 17:11.989
Friend's magic...

17:12.489 --> 17:13.782
That's it!

17:16.368 --> 17:19.455
I can only keep their attention
off Coco for so long.

17:19.538 --> 17:20.372
Hurry...

17:20.456 --> 17:21.373
Hey.

17:21.874 --> 17:25.627
That magic's pretty, sure, but is that it?

17:25.711 --> 17:28.005
It's just lighting up the sky.

17:28.088 --> 17:29.798
It's not doing anything!

17:30.382 --> 17:32.301
Can it carry someone and fly?

17:32.384 --> 17:34.803
Or go down and help?

17:34.887 --> 17:36.638
Well...

17:37.139 --> 17:39.808
Forget it. I'll go down and help myself.

17:40.517 --> 17:42.144
If he sees now...

17:43.145 --> 17:45.481
No! You can't go that way!

17:55.783 --> 17:56.617
Will...

17:56.700 --> 17:58.827
will you pull us?

17:58.911 --> 18:01.038
I can't get down.

18:01.830 --> 18:03.749
Oh... all right.

18:11.673 --> 18:13.258
- Are you okay?
- Are you hurt?

18:17.971 --> 18:18.847
You all right?

18:20.099 --> 18:21.683
Stop floating!

18:21.767 --> 18:23.769
Coco, you...

18:30.692 --> 18:32.986
- Thank goodness!
- Hey!

18:33.070 --> 18:36.573
I'm so glad it worked!
I didn't know what to do!

18:37.241 --> 18:39.243
Really and truly...

18:40.035 --> 18:41.829
Thank goodness!

18:41.912 --> 18:44.123
Hey, cut it out.

18:44.206 --> 18:48.085
More importantly,
how did you get out of that situation?

18:50.045 --> 18:51.839
What is this?

18:52.589 --> 18:53.674
Sand?

18:54.675 --> 18:55.926
Yeah.

18:56.009 --> 19:00.556
I remembered how we were just saved
by a spell that breaks rocks!

19:01.974 --> 19:02.808
I see.

19:03.642 --> 19:05.269
With the Wall Breaker Seal,

19:05.352 --> 19:07.646
even a small seal can turn

19:07.729 --> 19:10.399
only the rock into sand
without hurting anyone.

19:10.983 --> 19:15.154
Yes. Back then, I couldn't help at all,

19:15.737 --> 19:18.740
but a friend's magic saved us.

19:19.241 --> 19:21.410
I couldn't have done it alone.

19:22.828 --> 19:25.164
Seeing that glowing bird made me remember.

19:26.165 --> 19:28.667
Thank you for saving me, Agott.

19:29.501 --> 19:32.880
That light signal
was to call the masters back.

19:32.963 --> 19:35.174
Don't think it was just for you.

19:35.674 --> 19:38.427
Besides, I don't recall us
becoming friends--

19:44.099 --> 19:46.226
I'm so glad

19:47.603 --> 19:49.688
we were able to save Custas.

19:51.523 --> 19:54.443
And my mother too, someday...

19:56.236 --> 19:57.196
No.

19:57.946 --> 20:00.490
I will, for sure.

20:21.595 --> 20:23.764
What is this?!

20:24.514 --> 20:26.934
A silver-white capture pennant...

20:27.643 --> 20:32.689
And that crimson cloak and feathered hat...

20:35.150 --> 20:36.068
Don't tell me,

20:36.818 --> 20:37.903
the Knights Moralis!

20:39.154 --> 20:40.614
Which one of you?

20:41.949 --> 20:43.867
Which one used magic?

20:43.951 --> 20:44.952
Was it you?

20:45.744 --> 20:47.287
Or you?

20:49.039 --> 20:51.833
You may be children,
but I won't go easy on you.

20:52.501 --> 20:53.335
Who was it?

20:54.086 --> 20:56.338
Who is the agent of the Brimmed Caps?

20:56.421 --> 20:57.339
What?

20:57.422 --> 21:00.717
We're not! We're not Brimmed Caps!

21:00.801 --> 21:02.970
We didn't use forbidden magic.

21:03.053 --> 21:05.264
We used magic to help people.

21:06.515 --> 21:07.724
In that case,

21:08.308 --> 21:09.726
take a look below.

21:19.403 --> 21:20.237
What?

21:21.071 --> 21:23.323
What is that?

21:25.033 --> 21:27.536
Not just the rock, but the riverbed too.

21:28.036 --> 21:30.205
Everything turned to sand...

21:31.832 --> 21:35.127
Even the river turned into mist.

21:37.838 --> 21:40.257
No way. This...

21:40.966 --> 21:42.384
I didn't draw this.

21:42.467 --> 21:43.593
I see.

21:44.094 --> 21:46.179
So this is your magic.

21:47.556 --> 21:49.808
There's no way an apprentice like you

21:49.891 --> 21:54.771
could wield magic so powerful
without breaking the taboo.

21:56.857 --> 21:59.860
The laws set on
the Day of the Pact are absolute.

22:00.360 --> 22:03.322
You will be punished with oblivion.

23:33.787 --> 23:35.997
Subtitle translation by: Emily Noguchi

23:36.998 --> 23:41.002
EPISODE 8:
UNDER THE KNIGHTS MORALIS' SUSPICION
